    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "수풀 배회",
        "tooltip": "니달리는 <span>쿠거의 상</span> 스킬 레벨을 하나 보유한 상태로 시작합니다. <br /><br />수풀에 들어가면 2초 동안 니달리의 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가</span> 증가합니다. 적 챔피언 쪽으로 이동할 때는 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가</span>까지 증가합니다.<br /><br />챔피언이나 정글 몬스터가 <span>창 투척</span>이나 <span>매복 덫</span>에 적중하면 4초 동안 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">사냥</span> 대상이 됩니다. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">사냥</span>당하는 적이 있으면 <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">절대 시야</span>로 해당 적의 모습이 드러나며 니달리의 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가</span> 증가합니다. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">사냥</span>당하는 적 쪽으로 이동할 때는 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가</span>까지 증가합니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Prowl",
        "tooltip": "Nidalee starts with a rank in <span>Aspect of the Cougar</span>. <br /><br />Nidalee gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> for 2 seconds when entering Brush, increased to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> while moving toward enemy champions.<br /><br />Hitting champions or jungle monsters with <span>Javelin Toss</span> or <span>Bushwhack</span> marks them as <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hunted</span> for 4 seconds. While an enemy is <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hunted</span>, they are revealed with <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> and Nidalee gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span>, increased to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> toward the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Hunted</span> enemy."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "寻觅",
        "tooltip": "奈德丽自带1级<span>美洲狮形态</span>。<br /><br />奈德丽在进入草丛时会获得持续2秒的<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>，在朝着敌方英雄移动时会提升至<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>。<br /><br />用<span>标枪投掷</span>或<span>丛林伏击</span>命中英雄或野怪时，会将其标记为被<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">捕猎</span>状态，持续4秒。在一名敌人被<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">捕猎</span>时，其会被<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">真实视野</span>给显形并且奈德丽获得<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>，在朝着被<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">捕猎</span>的敌人移动时会提升至<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>。"
